<cap:headline>Due to continuous increase of water level of River Katakhal at Matizuri in Hailakandi district of Assam, Citizens are advised to stay away from the river. Issued in Public Interest by ASDMA.</cap:headline>
<cap:description>River Katakhal at Matizuri in Hailakandi district of Assam continues to flow in above normal flood situation at 12:00 pm today. At 12:00 pm, it was flowing at a level of 19.27 m with Rising trend which is 0.00 m above its Warning Level of 19.27 m and 1.00 m below its Danger Level of 20.27 m.</cap:description>
